76,"text":"橫艾涒灘始元元年。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":77,"text":"十二。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":78,"text":"大餘為三十九，小餘為七百五。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":79,"text":"大餘為三十九，小餘為二十四。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":80,"text":"尚章作噩二年。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":81,"text":"十二。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":82,"text":"大餘為三十四，小餘為一百一十三。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":83,"text":"大餘為四十五，無小餘。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":84,"text":"焉逢淹茂三年。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":85,"text":"閏為十三。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":86,"text":"大餘為二十八，小餘為四百六十一。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":87,"text":"大餘為五十，小餘為八。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":88,"text":"端蒙大淵獻四年。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":89,"text":"十二。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":90,"text":"大餘為五十二，小餘為三百六十八。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":91,"text":"大餘為五十五，小餘為十六。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":92,"text":"游兆困敦五年。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":93,"text":"十二。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":94,"text":"大餘為四十六，小餘為七百一十六。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":95,"text":"無大餘，小餘為二十四。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":96,"text":"彊梧赤奮若六年。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":97,"text":"閏為十三。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":98,"text":"大餘為四十一，小餘為一百二十四。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":99,"text":"大餘為六，無小餘。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":100,"text":"徒維攝提格元鳳元年。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":101,"text":"十二。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":102,"text":"大餘為五，小餘為三十一。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":103,"text":"大餘為十一，小餘為八。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":104,"text":"祝犁單閼二年。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":105,"text":"十二。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":106,"text":"大餘為五十九，小餘為三百七十九。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":107,"text":"大餘為十六，小餘為十六。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":108,"text":"商橫執徐三年。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":109,"text":"閏為十三。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":110,"text":"大餘為五十三，小餘為七百二十七。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":111,"text":"大餘為二十一，小餘為二十四。"},{"sectionIndex":1,"blockIndex":112,"text":"昭陽大荒落四年。"